colmat-next-rs is a trial rebuild of colmat (https://github.com/tensor4all/colmat-rs).

Ported material
  Code in crates/colmat-traits and crates/colmat-core is ported from colmat-rs
  (https://github.com/tensor4all/colmat-rs), which is a fork of faer:

    faer
    https://codeberg.org/sarah-quinones/faer
    Copyright (c) 2026 sarah quiñones el kazdadi
    License: MIT

  colmat-rs states (its NOTICE) that its source is upstream faer plus
  tensor4all modifications, and that those modifications are Copyright (c)
  tensor4all contributors and released under the same MIT license. The ported
  files carry both: faer's notice and the tensor4all contributors' modifications,
  under MIT. The MIT text with faer's copyright line is in each crate's
  LICENSE-faer. Each ported module names the colmat-rs file and commit it was
  ported from and what was changed.

  No file ported so far comes from the parts of colmat-rs that are themselves
  ported from other projects (Eigen, LAPACK, reference BLAS); those keep their
  own licenses in colmat-rs and are not in this repository.

